{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id787359312"}, "name":{"label":"Hhhhhhhhhhhhg9"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-03T18:41:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"13353654148"}, "title":{"label":"Heartwarming (updated)"}, "content":{"label":"I thought it was a random lego game at first but then i figured out the whole story. It was so heartwarming and lovely. It could make someone cry (in a good way) I wish there were more content\n\n\nMy ‘prayers’ were answered! The robots journey is here! So excited to do it!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
