{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1420505000"}, "name":{"label":"OrangeYoshi333"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-15T13:41:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"13141869277"}, "title":{"label":":),"}, "content":{"label":"I played this a while ago and then remembered about it the other day. I love the nostalgia and how the robot’s story is concluded with this new update", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id636921014"}, "name":{"label":"purplebanana66"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-05T08:24:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"13102081773"}, "title":{"label":"Phenomenal"}, "content":{"label":"Everything about this game is just perfect. The story is easy to understand and well conveyed even without words. The puzzles are interesting, unique, fun to do, and aren’t annoyingly difficult. The soundtrack is beautiful and full of emotion. The sound design is also incredibly well done, and makes moving pieces around very satisfying. The controls are simple and effective, and for the most part it’s obvious which bricks you can pick up and which are just part of the environment. Speaking of which, the environments in this game are masterpieces in their own right. The amount of detail in even the simplest ones is remarkable, and nearly all of them look like they can actually be recreated with real LEGO pieces. Great work from everyone involved, thank you so much for creating this gem of a game, and I look forward to seeing what this studio produces in the future!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1140143307"}, "name":{"label":"fishcakess/fishy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-02T21:16:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"13092588760"}, "title":{"label":"Lovely Game"}, "content":{"label":"I thought this had gotten taken down… I reinstalled it recently. I cannot explain how nostalgic this was for me, and it warms my heart to see it back on here, and I’ve been playing it nonstop. Thank you for creating this, you all are lovely people. Keep up your great work! <3", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
