{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id40694083"}, "name":{"label":"JazGalaxy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-06-13T12:40:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"12770669799"}, "title":{"label":"Bad design"}, "content":{"label":"I HATE tutorials and minimalist zen nonsense. I started the game and dumbly followed their obvious and unnecessary tutorial until I got to the phase that says “use two fingers to look around”. I did. I looked around… and nothing happened. \n\nWhatever is supposed to happen next is either BROKEN or intentionally under-communicated for “zen effect”, which is maddeningly frustrating.\n\nTutorials should NEVER be forced and under-communicaring for effect is pretentious and daft.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
