{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id403524012"}, "name":{"label":"Mikey4dice"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-22T18:31:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"11190203550"}, "title":{"label":"Such a cute game but I can’t see"}, "content":{"label":"I guess my eyes have reach the point of old age because I really wish I could zoom in a little. And sometimes I don’t know what I’m supposed to do. Hints would be helpful. \nI don’t think I can play anymore unless they do some kind of improvement for my old eyes.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id221382630"}, "name":{"label":"CuriouslyMe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-17T09:11:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"11169836551"}, "title":{"label":"Cute cozy game"}, "content":{"label":"I’m surprised by the amount of bad reviews. The game controls could be better but they’re not too bad once you get used to them. The puzzles are pretty simple with some of them requiring a bit more trial and error than others. Bottom line, you’re trying to get the lego kid from one place on the map to another… its not that complicated! Overall, I found this to be an enjoyable cozy game with a cute little story and I recommended it!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id452962951"}, "name":{"label":"Xsuperkingx"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-07T04:35:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"11131379169"}, "title":{"label":"It’s beautiful"}, "content":{"label":"It’s simple. Just the right amount of challenging. And it looks AMAZING. Must play for any LEGO fan. Best Apple Arcade game there is and will ever be. Hoping for an update with another journey.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
